ADR-0001-TypeScript-단일-언어.md:18:## 결과\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0001-TypeScript-단일-언어.md:19:+ 타입 공유(Gateway 이벤트·UI·전이), 단일 빌드 체인. − CPU 집약 작업은 worker_threads/별도 프로세스 필요.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0001-TypeScript-단일-언어.md:20:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0001-TypeScript-단일-언어.md:21:## 재검토 조건\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0001-TypeScript-단일-언어.md:22:V1 성능 시험에서 배치·worker·프로파일링 후에도 Node CPU 포화로 이벤트 수신→저널 확정 p95가 목표 초과, 또는 OS 격리 요구를 기존 경로로 충족 불가(침투 테스트)일 때만 네이티브 헬퍼 재검토.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:1:# ADR-0002: Electron 데스크톱 프레임워크\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:2:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:3:| 메타 | 값 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:4:|---|---|\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:5:| 상태 | ACCEPTED(R1 수렴) |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:6:| 날짜 | 2026-11-01 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:7:| 근거 문서 | `ARCHITECTURE_DEBATE.md`, `CLAUDE_INITIAL_PROPOSAL.md`, `CODEX_INITIAL_PROPOSAL.md`, `evidence/research/*` |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:8:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:9:## 맥락\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:10:Monaco·xterm.js·Git Diff를 품는 IDE형 UI, 자식 프로세스 stdin/stdout/kill 완전 제어, 3-OS 배포. Tauri는 Rust 필수 + SDK용 Node 사이드카로 런타임 2개.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:11:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:12:## 결정\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:13:Electron 45.x. renderer sandbox·contextIsolation 등 R2-1 쟁점 7 설정을 필수 완료 기준으로 한다.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:14:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:15:## 검토한 대안\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:16:Tauri v2(Rust 툴체인·WebKit 차이·사이드카), Avalonia(.NET SDK 없음·웹 컴포넌트 재사용 불가), Qt/PySide6(LGPL·웹 컴포넌트 비용).\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:17:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:18:## 결과\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:19:+ Chromium 일관성, 런타임 1개, 공식 보안 체크리스트. − 설치 크기·메모리(수치 UNVERIFIED).\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:20:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:21:## 재검토 조건\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md:22:설치 크기·메모리 실측(Phase 00·11)에서 수용 불가 수준이면 재검토.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:1:# ADR-0004: React 19 + 외부 store(useSyncExternalStore) + 저널 seq 배치\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:2:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:3:| 메타 | 값 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:4:|---|---|\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:5:| 상태 | ACCEPTED(R2-1 쟁점 4 조건부 합의) |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:6:| 날짜 | 2026-11-01 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:7:| 근거 문서 | `ARCHITECTURE_DEBATE.md`, `CLAUDE_INITIAL_PROPOSAL.md`, `CODEX_INITIAL_PROPOSAL.md`, `evidence/research/*` |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:8:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:9:## 맥락\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:10:고빈도 토큰 델타가 React 상태를 직접 갱신하면 렌더가 밀림. 작업 상태의 권위는 SQLite 투영.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:11:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:12:## 결정\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:13:렌더러는 읽기 전용 외부 store를 `useSyncExternalStore`로 구독, `lastAppliedSeq` 기반 재접속, rAF당 1회 스냅샷, 카드 단위 가상화. 상태 라이브러리(Zustand 등)는 화면 복잡도 확인 후 결정.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:14:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:15:## 검토한 대안\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:16:Vue/Svelte(스킬 생태계·래퍼 얇음), Zustand 즉시 확정(기각: 필요성 미확인).\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:17:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:18:## 결과\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:19:+ 공식 구독 모델, 라이브러리 비의존. − 배치 규칙 구현 책임이 앱에 있음.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:20:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:21:## 재검토 조건\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md:22:합성 부하 1,000 delta/s에서 p95 100ms 초과 또는 재접속 누락 발생 시 설계 재검토.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:1:# ADR-0006: Agent Gateway: Claude = Agent SDK, Codex = app-server(JSON-RPC)\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:2:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:3:| 메타 | 값 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:4:|---|---|\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:5:| 상태 | ACCEPTED(R1 수렴, 공식 조사 근거) |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:6:| 날짜 | 2026-11-01 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:7:| 근거 문서 | `ARCHITECTURE_DEBATE.md`, `CLAUDE_INITIAL_PROPOSAL.md`, `CODEX_INITIAL_PROPOSAL.md`, `evidence/research/*` |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:8:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:9:## 맥락\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:10:승인 요청을 프로그램이 수신·응답하는 경로가 Claude는 SDK `canUseTool`, Codex는 app-server 서버→클라이언트 요청만. `codex exec`/SDK는 승인 콜백 부재.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:11:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:12:## 결정\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:13:`AgentGateway` 작은 인터페이스(startRun/steer/interrupt/respondApproval/listSessions/resumeRun/forkRun — R4A-10 이후 `startRun(spec.mode)`·`respond(requestId, answer)`로 통합, 정본은 AGENT_INTEGRATION §1) 뒤에 `ClaudeSdkAdapter`(`pathToClaudeCodeExecutable`=사용자 CLI)와 `CodexAppServerAdapter`(stdio). 공통 이벤트 스키마로 정규화. CLI 직접 구동은 fallback(Codex는 읽기 전용 일회성 분석만).\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:14:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:15:## 검토한 대안\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:16:Codex `exec --json`(승인·steer·interrupt 없음), Codex SDK(exec 래퍼), Claude CLI stream-json(가능하나 SDK가 상위).\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:17:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:18:## 결과\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:19:+ 모든 외부 효과가 브로커 통과. − app-server 전체 experimental·v1/v2 스키마 → CI에서 generate-json-schema 고정.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:20:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:21:## 재검토 조건\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md:22:app-server 장기 안정성 실측(Phase 00) 실패 시 범위 축소·버전 고정 전략 재검토.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:1:# ADR-0003: C Hybrid: Electron Shell + 독립 Node 오케스트레이터 데몬\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:2:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:3:| 메타 | 값 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:4:|---|---|\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:5:| 상태 | ACCEPTED(R1 양측 독립 추천 51/60·47/60) |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:6:| 날짜 | 2026-11-01 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:7:| 근거 문서 | `ARCHITECTURE_DEBATE.md`, `CLAUDE_INITIAL_PROPOSAL.md`, `CODEX_INITIAL_PROPOSAL.md`, `evidence/research/*` |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:8:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:9:## 맥락\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:10:앱 종료 후 작업 지속(REQ-GOAL-06), UI 크래시와 작업 분리, SQLite 단일 writer, 향후 OS 서비스 승격.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:11:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:12:## 결정\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:13:Shell(main)은 창·트레이·업데이트·데몬 기동/접속만. 데몬이 Gateway·Scheduler·ApprovalBroker·SkillRegistry·SessionIndex·SQLite를 소유. localhost WS JSON-RPC + 토큰 + 프로토콜 버전.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:14:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:15:## 검토한 대안\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:16:A Python 사이드카(언어 2개, Codex SDK 부재), B Electron main 통합/Tauri Rust(백그라운드 지속·장애 분리 불리).\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:17:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:18:## 결과\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:19:+ 복구·백그라운드·다중 에이전트 제어 최고점. − 데몬 생명주기(Windows detached·좀비·재접속)가 최대 위험.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:20:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:21:## 재검토 조건\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md:22:Phase 00 E1~E5 실험 실패 시 MVP 범위를 \"안전 중단·재개\"로 축소(R2-3 결정).\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0007-인증-모드를-공급자별-1급-설정으로,-MVP-기본-API-key.md:1:# ADR-0007: 인증 모드를 공급자별 1급 설정으로, MVP 기본 API key\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0007-인증-모드를-공급자별-1급-설정으로,-MVP-기본-API-key.md:2:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0007-인증-모드를-공급자별-1급-설정으로,-MVP-기본-API-key.md:3:| 메타 | 값 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0007-인증-모드를-공급자별-1급-설정으로,-MVP-기본-API-key.md:4:|---|---|\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0007-인증-모드를-공급자별-1급-설정으로,-MVP-기본-API-key.md:5:| 상태 | **ACCEPTED**(사용자 결정 2026-11-01, 선택 (b): 설치된 CLI 