시 API key 전환 필요. (과거 분석 — 원 제안 (a) API key 기본: + 약관 위험 격리 − 구독 사용자의 기대와 어긋남, API 과금.)\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0007-인증-모드를-공급자별-1급-설정으로,-MVP-기본-API-key.md:20:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0007-인증-모드를-공급자별-1급-설정으로,-MVP-기본-API-key.md:21:## 재검토 조건\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0007-인증-모드를-공급자별-1급-설정으로,-MVP-기본-API-key.md:22:사용자 결정 완료: (b). 재검토 조건: 공급자 약관이 CLI 로그인 재사용을 명시적으로 금지하거나 P00 S3 실측에서 차단될 때 → API key 기본으로 전환(ADR 개정, R21).\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:1:# ADR-0005: SQLite(WAL) + append-only 이벤트 저널, better-sqlite3\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:2:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:3:| 메타 | 값 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:4:|---|---|\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:5:| 상태 | ACCEPTED(R1 수렴, R2-1 쟁점 2 조건부 합의) |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:6:| 날짜 | 2026-11-01 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:7:| 근거 문서 | `ARCHITECTURE_DEBATE.md`, `CLAUDE_INITIAL_PROPOSAL.md`, `CODEX_INITIAL_PROPOSAL.md`, `evidence/research/*` |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:8:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:9:## 맥락\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:10:로컬 단일 사용자, 복구 신뢰성, 감사. SQLite는 \"one writer at a time\" → 데몬 단일 writer. node:sqlite는 Node 24에서 RC(1.2).\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:11:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:12:## 결정\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:13:better-sqlite3 고정 버전, 드라이버 인터페이스 뒤에 격리. 저널 원본 + 투영 파생. 백업은 온라인 백업 API/VACUUM INTO(WAL 파일 단독 복사 금지).\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:14:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:15:## 검토한 대안\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:16:node:sqlite(RC), PostgreSQL(로컬 앱에 과함), 파일 JSON(원자성 약함).\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:17:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:18:## 결과\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:19:+ 동기 API·prebuilt. − 네이티브 바이너리 배포 실패 위험(데몬 런타임 결정과 결합).\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:20:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:21:## 재검토 조건\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0005-SQLite.md:22:node:sqlite Stability 2 도달 + 트랜잭션·동시 읽기·백업·전원 손실 테스트 통과 + 3-OS 네이티브 제거 이득 확인 시 전환 검토.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:1:# ADR-0008: 패키징 electron-builder v26 + electron-updater\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:2:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:3:| 메타 | 값 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:4:|---|---|\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:5:| 상태 | ACCEPTED(R2-1 쟁점 1 합의, Codex가 Forge 철회) |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:6:| 날짜 | 2026-11-01 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:7:| 근거 문서 | `ARCHITECTURE_DEBATE.md`, `CLAUDE_INITIAL_PROPOSAL.md`, `CODEX_INITIAL_PROPOSAL.md`, `evidence/research/*` |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:8:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:9:## 맥락\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:10:Electron 내장 autoUpdater는 Linux 미지원, update.electronjs.org는 공개 GitHub 전제. 네이티브 의존성·다중 OS 업데이트 메타데이터를 한 설정 체계에서.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:11:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:12:## 결정\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:13:Windows NSIS(MSI는 기업 요구 시), macOS DMG + Developer ID 서명·notarization, Linux AppImage(updater 채널) + deb(패키지 관리자). 3-OS CI 호스트. 공개 배포물 서명 필수, 내부 dev 빌드 unsigned 허용(자동 업데이트 금지). 실행 중 작업 있으면 업데이트 적용 연기.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:14:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:15:## 검토한 대안\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:16:Electron Forge(공식이나 updater 범위), 자체 업데이터(공급망 위험).\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:17:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:18:## 결과\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:19:+ 공식·준공식 경로. − 서명 자격 CI 노출, notarization.\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:20:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:21:## 재검토 조건\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md:22:—\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\README.md:1:# ADR 색인\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\README.md:2:\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\README.md:3:| ADR | 제목 | 상태 |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\README.md:4:|---|---|---|\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\README.md:5:| 0001 | [TypeScript 단일 언어](ADR-0001-TypeScript-단일-언어.md) | ACCEPTED(R1 수렴, R2-1 쟁점 6 합의) |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\README.md:6:| 0002 | [Electron 데스크톱 프레임워크](ADR-0002-Electron-데스크톱-프레임워크.md) | ACCEPTED(R1 수렴) |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\README.md:7:| 0003 | [C Hybrid: Electron Shell + 독립 Node 오케스트레이터 데몬](ADR-0003-C-Hybrid.md) | ACCEPTED(R1 양측 독립 추천 51/60·47/60) |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\README.md:8:| 0004 | [React 19 + 외부 store(useSyncExternalStore) + 저널 seq 배치](ADR-0004-React-19-+-외부-store.md) | ACCEPTED(R2-1 쟁점 4 조건부 합의) |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\README.md:9:| 0005 | [SQLite(WAL) + append-only 이벤트 저널, better-sqlite3](ADR-0005-SQLite.md) | ACCEPTED(R1 수렴, R2-1 쟁점 2 조건부 합의) |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\README.md:10:| 0006 | [Agent Gateway: Claude = Agent SDK, Codex = app-server(JSON-RPC)](ADR-0006-Agent-Gateway.md) | ACCEPTED(R1 수렴, 공식 조사 근거) |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\README.md:11:| 0007 | [인증 모드를 공급자별 1급 설정으로, MVP 기본 API key](ADR-0007-인증-모드를-공급자별-1급-설정으로,-MVP-기본-API-key.md) | ACCEPTED(사용자 결정 2026-11-01: (b) CLI 로그인 재사용 기본) |\ndocs/planning/01_architecture/adr\\README.md:12:| 0008 | [패키징 electron-builder v26 + electron-updater](ADR-0008-패키징-electron-builder-v26-+-electron-upda.md) | ACCEPTED(R2-1 쟁점 1 합의, Codex가 Forge 철회) |\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
